"1 pixel per point. Fastest." = "每点 1 个像素，速度最快。";
"1. Make sure **LocalDevVPN** is installed and connected. The VPN icon should be in the status bar.\n2. Wi-Fi must be on, even though nothing leaves your iPhone.\n3. **Developer Mode** must be on (Settings › Privacy & Security › Developer Mode).\n4. The first time, Husk downloads Apple's Developer Disk Image, which can take a minute. Let it finish.\n5. Still failing? Toggle LocalDevVPN off and on, then pair again." = "1. 确认已安装并连接 **LocalDevVPN**，状态栏应显示 VPN 图标。\n2. 开启 Wi-Fi，即使通信仅发生在 iPhone 本机。\n3. 开启**开发者模式**（设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 开发者模式）。\n4. 首次使用时，Husk 会下载 Apple 的开发者磁盘映像，可能需要一分钟，请等待完成。\n5. 仍然失败？断开并重新连接 LocalDevVPN，然后重新配对。";
"1.5 pixels per point." = "每点 1.5 个像素。";
"2 pixels per point. The default." = "每点 2 个像素，默认选项。";
"A %@ game. It runs through Husk's native runtime, which loads its %@ arm64 libraries itself." = "这是 %@ 游戏。它通过 Husk 的原生运行环境运行，由 Husk 加载 %@ 个 arm64 库。";
"A Flutter app. Its engine and its compiled Dart run natively through Husk's translation layer, which loads its %@ arm64 libraries itself." = "这是 Flutter 应用。其引擎和编译后的 Dart 代码通过 Husk 转译层原生运行，由 Husk 加载 %@ 个 arm64 库。";
