"Adds about 2 GB to the first download. It was captured on the software renderer, so it is not used on GPU — which cold-boots once and then saves its own." = "首次下载会增加约 2 GB。此快照基于软件渲染器创建，无法用于 GPU 模式；GPU 模式会先冷启动一次，再保存自己的快照。";
