"Android and Translation Layer games need JIT. StikJIT, built into Husk, turns it on without a computer." = "Android 和转译层游戏需要 JIT。Husk 内置的 StikJIT 无需电脑即可启用它。";
"Android and this app share the memory Husk runs translated code in, and together they do not fit. Close Husk and open it again, then start only the app (or only Android)." = "Android 和此应用共享转译代码所用的内存，当前内存不足。请关闭并重新打开 Husk，然后只启动此应用或只启动 Android。";
"Android apps and games are compiled while they run, which needs memory that can be written and then run. iOS only allows that while a debugger is attached to the app. Turning on JIT attaches one for a moment. Without it, Husk can show your library but cannot start Android or a game." = "Android 应用和游戏运行时需要编译代码，因此需要可写入并执行的内存。iOS 仅在应用附加调试器时允许这样做。启用 JIT 会短暂附加调试器。没有 JIT 时，Husk 可以显示应用库，但无法启动 Android 或游戏。";
"Android can't start without JIT" = "未启用 JIT，无法启动 Android";
"Android cannot reshape a screen once it is running, so a landscape game on a portrait screen gets letterboxed into a band and looks tiny. Creating it landscape is the only way it can fill it — portrait apps are letterboxed instead. Costs one cold boot." = "Android 运行后无法改变屏幕形状，因此横屏游戏在竖屏中会被压缩成一条窄带。以横屏启动才能让它铺满屏幕，此时竖屏应用会留黑边。更改后需要冷启动一次。";
"Android draws on the real GPU through Metal — about four times the frame rate. This is the default." = "Android 通过 Metal 使用真实 GPU 绘图，帧率约为软件渲染的四倍。这是默认选项。";
