"Android reaches the internet through a virtual ethernet card on QEMU's own network. Nothing on your phone's network can see the guest, and the guest cannot see it." = "Android 通过 QEMU 私有网络中的虚拟以太网卡访问互联网。手机所在网络中的设备无法访问虚拟机，虚拟机也无法访问这些设备。";
