"Husk needs memory it can write and then execute, which on iOS takes an attached debugger. There are two ways to get it: a debugger that services trap requests, or a MAP_JIT mapping, which the kernel allows any debugged process. Either one is enough — which is available depends on the device and the iOS version, so Husk tests both rather than assuming." = "Husk 需要可写入并执行的内存，在 iOS 上通常需要附加调试器。获取方式有两种：处理陷阱请求的调试器，或内核允许被调试进程创建的 MAP_JIT 映射。任一种可用即可，具体取决于设备和 iOS 版本，因此 Husk 会测试这两种方式。";
