"Husk restores a saved machine instead of booting it, which takes seconds rather than minutes. The picture freezes while it writes. With this off, nothing saves by itself — including after an install." = "Husk 可在几秒内恢复已保存的虚拟机，省去数分钟的启动时间。写入存档时画面会暂停。关闭后不会自动保存，包括安装应用之后。";
"Husk runs unmodified Android APKs in a real Android system on your iPhone. The console shows Husk's live log, the guest's serial output and QEMU's own output — the three files any problem here is diagnosed from." = "Husk 可在 iPhone 上的 Android 环境中运行未经修改的 APK。控制台显示 Husk 实时日志、虚拟机串口输出和 QEMU 输出，便于诊断问题。";
"Husk tells you when a new version is out. Install the new IPA over the old one with the same sideloader. Your library, apps and saves are kept." = "有新版本时 Husk 会提示。使用同一侧载工具，将新版 IPA 覆盖安装到旧版上，即可保留应用库、应用和存档。";
"Husk was marked as debugged when it opened, so JIT is on." = "Husk 启动时已被标记为已调试，因此 JIT 已启用。";
