"Tap **Connect LocalDevVPN**. It switches the VPN on and comes straight back to Husk." = "轻点**连接 LocalDevVPN**。它会开启 VPN，然后立即返回 Husk。";
"Tap **Enable JIT**. Husk's helper attaches and Android can start." = "轻点**启用 JIT**。Husk 的辅助进程附加成功后，即可启动 Android。";
"Tap **Start pairing** in Husk first and allow **Local Network** access when asked. If you said no earlier, turn it on in Settings › Privacy & Security › Local Network › Husk. Wi-Fi has to be on. Developer Mode must already be enabled, which restarts the iPhone the first time." = "请先在 Husk 中轻点**开始配对**，并在提示时允许访问**本地网络**。如果之前拒绝过，请在“设置 › 隐私与安全性 › 本地网络 › Husk”中开启。Wi-Fi 必须开启，并且应已启用开发者模式；首次启用开发者模式会重启 iPhone。";
"Tap + and pick a fake package (.pkg), a folder of packages, or an extracted game folder (eboot.bin and sce_sys). Husk installs it into PS4 Games in Files, and an update package goes beside the game it updates. Retail packages are locked to a PS4 and do not install. PS4 games need iOS 17.4 or later." = "轻点 +，选择 fake package（.pkg）、安装包文件夹或已解压的游戏文件夹（包含 eboot.bin 和 sce_sys）。Husk 会将它安装到“文件”中的“PS4 Games”，更新包则安装在对应游戏旁。零售安装包与 PS4 主机绑定，无法安装。PS4 游戏需要 iOS 17.4 或更高版本。";
"Tap + to add an Android APK or bundle (.xapk, .apkm, .apks), or a PS4 game: a fake package (.pkg), a folder of them, or an extracted game folder. You can also share files to Husk from Files or Safari." = "轻点 + 可添加 Android APK 或安装包（.xapk、.apkm、.apks），也可添加 PS4 的 fake package（.pkg）、安装包文件夹或已解压的游戏文件夹。还可从“文件”或 Safari 分享到 Husk。";
