"The helper did not attach within 90 seconds. Check that LocalDevVPN is connected, then try again." = "辅助进程未在 90 秒内附加。请检查 LocalDevVPN 是否已连接，然后重试。";
"The language apps and games inside Husk see. Husk itself follows your iPhone." = "Husk 内的应用和游戏使用的语言。Husk 自身跟随 iPhone 的语言设置。";
"The list is written to disk, so it is on screen before Android has finished starting." = "应用列表会保存到磁盘，因此在 Android 启动完成之前就能显示。";
"The pairing file stays in Husk's Documents folder and is only sent to Husk's own helper." = "配对文件保存在 Husk 的 Documents 文件夹中，仅会发送给 Husk 自己的辅助进程。";
"The panel is built when the machine starts, so a change costs one cold boot, and the next save replaces the machine saved at the old size — changing back costs another. Sizes are rounded to a multiple of eight. Bigger is slower: every pixel is drawn by an emulated phone. Android's density does not change with the panel, so a larger one shows more rather than bigger." = "屏幕尺寸在虚拟机启动时确定。更改后需要冷启动一次，下次保存会覆盖旧尺寸的存档；改回原尺寸也需要冷启动。尺寸会取整为 8 的倍数。分辨率越大，运行越慢。Android 的显示密度不随尺寸改变，因此更大的屏幕会显示更多内容，而非放大内容。";
"The plan, in order, is docs/04-translation-layer.md in Husk's source." = "按顺序排列的计划位于 Husk 源码中的 docs/04-translation-layer.md。";
"The report holds the full log of that run and which device and build it was on. Nothing is sent anywhere unless you share it." = "报告包含此次运行的完整日志、设备信息和构建版本。只有主动分享时才会发送。";
"The request for Husk's JIT helper could not be encoded." = "无法编码发送给 Husk JIT 辅助进程的请求。";
"The runtime could not start it. The report says which part was missing." = "运行环境无法启动它。报告中说明了缺少的组件。";
