"This APK has no 64-bit code Husk can run, so it will probably not start." = "此 APK 没有 Husk 可运行的 64 位代码，因此可能无法启动。";
"This app carries anti-tamper protection (%@). Such protection checks that it runs on a certified Android phone and closes the app otherwise, so it may not start in Husk." = "此应用包含防篡改保护（%@），会检查是否运行在通过认证的 Android 手机上，否则关闭应用，因此可能无法在 Husk 中启动。";
"This app does its main work in Linux programs it starts as processes of their own (here %@). Its own screens run in Husk, but iOS does not let an app start other processes, so those programs, and the games or tools they run, can not start yet." = "此应用的主要功能由独立 Linux 进程完成（此处为 %@）。应用界面可在 Husk 中运行，但 iOS 不允许应用启动其他进程，因此这些程序及其运行的游戏或工具暂时无法启动。";
"This app is published in several pieces (split APKs) and only its base was imported, so its libraries or resources are missing. Import the whole bundle (.apks, .xapk or .apkm), or get it from Husk's store." = "此应用由多个拆分 APK 组成，但只导入了基础包，缺少库或资源。请导入完整的 .apks、.xapk 或 .apkm，或从 Husk 商店下载。";
